      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19932\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19933\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtable.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19933\u0026quot;,228)\"\u003e to view the table.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eWe see that the first whole number value for \u003ci\u003er\u003c/i\u003efor which the volume of the region is greater than 100 cubic units is 3.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-11 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_2_80/f-80-2-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
